{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8ab52c937ff3814a","name":"Industrial Automaton","source":{"id":"source:reference-8ab52c937ff3814a","title":"Industrial Automaton","revision":24505,"timestamp":"2024-11-03T15:44:43Z","sha256":"bb4ecd3672416546cfb62979ada0918f791c5219b94a7ee6aafb4409c392f78f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24505","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Industrial%20Automaton&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8ab52c937ff3814a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The hugely successful R-Series Astromech Droids make Industrial Automaton one of the galaxy's more successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Manufacturers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Manufacturers","referenceId":"reference:41c1bfb8b5b00c0a"},". Industrial Automaton competes with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cybot Galactica"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cybot_Galactica","referenceId":"reference:8d89ff519236e3e2"}," in price, product, and service, and its sales and maintenance facilities can be found on any civilized planet with a sufficiently advanced tech level or a major starport. IA's major production lines are on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Telti"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Telti","referenceId":"reference:83d5ffdea6efb2a1"},", but it also employs factories throughout the galaxy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Manufacturer Traits:"]}," Industrial Automaton Astromechs can be found in most starports, and technicians are used to working with IA units. When using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," Action on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check, an Industrial Automaton Droid ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," can add its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," bonus (minimum +1) to the normal +2 bonus.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
